WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.243 --> 00:00:14.425
will we defeat Sun Wukong?"

2
00:00:14.925 --> 00:00:16.266
moaned the Jade Emperor.

3
00:00:16.286 --> 00:00:20.069
"I sent our entire army, and they couldn't arrest him!"

4
00:00:20.089 --> 00:00:26.093
"Perhaps we can ask the sage Erlang to capture him," said Guanyin.

5
00:00:26.113 --> 00:00:29.836
"Yes," said the Jade Emperor.

6
00:00:31.296 --> 00:00:32.876
"Erlang is very powerful."

7
00:00:33.837 --> 00:00:35.437
He turned back to the messenger.

8
00:00:36.537 --> 00:00:37.278
to Plum Mountain.

9
00:00:38.298 --> 00:00:39.798
Ask Erlang if he'll help us."

10
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:47.981
Wukong stood in front of the waterfall with his cheering subjects.

11
00:00:48.001 --> 00:00:53.322
"Our king has just defeated an entire army from Heaven!"

12
00:00:53.602 --> 00:00:54.222
said the gibbon.

13
00:00:54.242 --> 00:00:59.944
"I hope the Jade Emperor learned his lesson," said Wukong.

14
00:01:00.864 --> 00:01:04.247
"He and his army are no match for—" "Sun Wukong!"

15
00:01:04.788 --> 00:01:06.469
a deep voice boomed.

16
00:01:08.631 --> 00:01:09.071
looked up.

17
00:01:10.412 --> 00:01:12.975
A large man was coming down from the sky.

18
00:01:14.176 --> 00:01:16.438
The apes and other monkeys ran and hid.

19
00:01:20.861 --> 00:01:22.483
am Erlang," said the man.

20
00:01:22.503 --> 00:01:25.946
"The Jade Emperor sent me to arrest you."

21
00:01:27.427 --> 00:01:28.348
Wukong laughed.

22
00:01:30.284 --> 00:01:32.745
"The Jade Emperor's entire army couldn't defeat me.

23
00:01:33.645 --> 00:01:35.125
What do you think you're going to do?"

24
00:01:36.446 --> 00:01:39.447
"I am going to take you back to Heaven," said Erlang.

25
00:01:40.287 --> 00:01:42.808
"And you will be punished!"

26
00:01:43.648 --> 00:01:47.169
Waving his iron bar, Wukong leaped at Erlang.

27
00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:54.071
Erlang blocked the bar with his sword and then struck back.

28
00:01:55.571 --> 00:01:58.412
Wukong jumped onto a cloud to get out of the way.

29
00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:01.429
Erlang leaped into the air.

30
00:02:04.749 --> 00:02:07.430
He shook his body and suddenly grew much bigger.

31
00:02:08.491 --> 00:02:09.491
Wukong laughed.

32
00:02:09.511 --> 00:02:12.192
"I can do that too!"

33
00:02:13.632 --> 00:02:16.913
He shook his body and grew just as big as Erlang.

34
00:02:22.735 --> 00:02:27.156
Clouds swirled and wind blew as the two giants fought in the sky.

35
00:02:27.928 --> 00:02:30.430
Their weapons banged together all through the night.

36
00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:35.012
They were still fighting when the sun rose the next morning.

37
00:02:35.032 --> 00:02:39.655
"This fight could last forever," thought Wukong.

38
00:02:39.675 --> 00:02:41.916
"I should try a different plan."

39
00:02:43.397 --> 00:02:48.460
Wukong struck at Erlang one last time and then jumped back down to Earth.

40
00:02:52.202 --> 00:02:55.424
He turned himself into a sparrow and perched on a branch.

41
00:02:56.896 --> 00:02:59.518
"Erlang will never find me now," thought Wukong.

42
00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.461
looked up and saw a hawk.

43
00:03:03.542 --> 00:03:05.223
The hawk swooped toward him.

44
00:03:06.204 --> 00:03:06.744
"Oh no!"

45
00:03:07.045 --> 00:03:07.925
thought Wukong.

46
00:03:07.945 --> 00:03:09.286
"That's Erlang!"

47
00:03:10.387 --> 00:03:12.429
Wukong dived into a stream.

48
00:03:14.451 --> 00:03:17.453
He turned himself into a fish and swam in the water.

49
00:03:19.155 --> 00:03:21.977
But then a crane flew over the stream.

50
00:03:23.618 --> 00:03:25.280
crane swooped down at the water.

51
00:03:26.128 --> 00:03:27.429
Its mouth was wide open.

52
00:03:28.589 --> 00:03:30.350
Wukong shot out of the stream.

53
00:03:31.931 --> 00:03:35.152
He changed back into himself and ran down a hill.

54
00:03:35.172 --> 00:03:39.334
"I'll turn myself into a temple," he thought.

55
00:03:39.354 --> 00:03:42.996
"Then, if Erlang tries to enter, I'll bite him!"

56
00:03:48.338 --> 00:03:52.360
Wukong's eyes became windows, and his mouth became a door.

57
00:03:53.864 --> 00:03:56.225
He turned his tail into a flagpole.

58
00:03:57.426 --> 00:03:59.866
A moment later Erlang came down the hill.

59
00:04:01.207 --> 00:04:03.468
When he saw the temple, he scratched his head.

60
00:04:05.869 --> 00:04:06.509
said Erlang.

61
00:04:06.529 --> 00:04:09.630
"I never saw a temple with a flagpole before.

62
00:04:11.031 --> 00:04:12.031
must be Wukong.

63
00:04:13.352 --> 00:04:14.652
I'll kick in that door."

64
00:04:14.732 --> 00:04:16.653
"Oh no!"

65
00:04:16.973 --> 00:04:17.714
thought Wukong.

66
00:04:17.734 --> 00:04:19.774
"He'll break all my teeth!"

67
00:04:21.355 --> 00:04:23.476
changed back into himself and ran.

68
00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:28.701
Erlang was right behind him.

69
00:04:30.481 --> 00:04:35.043
Up in Heaven the Jade Emperor, the queen, and Guanyin watched the chase.

70
00:04:37.263 --> 00:04:39.724
The sage Laozi came over to them.

71
00:04:39.744 --> 00:04:41.965
"What's going on?"

72
00:04:42.285 --> 00:04:43.565
he asked, looking down.

73
00:04:44.746 --> 00:04:49.307
"That monkey, Sun Wukong, ate all the peaches from the garden," said the Jade Emperor.

74
00:04:50.847 --> 00:04:52.508
he defeated our entire army.

75
00:04:53.572 --> 00:04:55.454
Erlang is trying to catch him now."

76
00:04:55.534 --> 00:04:58.696
"I can help," said Laozi.

77
00:04:59.837 --> 00:05:01.878
He took a metal ring off his arm.

78
00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:07.523
He aimed carefully and hurled it down to Earth.

79
00:05:13.987 --> 00:05:15.528
The ring hit Wukong on the head.

80
00:05:16.409 --> 00:05:19.972
The monkey looked dizzy for a moment and then fell to the ground.
